|CKBFighter|000

|CK0Fighters are durable weapon masters built for direct, dependable combat.
They can use almost any weapon or armour and develop a large set of attacks,
defensive reactions, rescue tools, and battlefield controls.|000

|CKBHow it plays|000
|CK0Worthy combat earns Fighter XP and raises Guild Level automatically.
Defensive toggles such as counter, feint, guts, and shieldblock spend Endurance
when they trigger; fsurge restores that reserve. The result is an active front
line that can change stance and protect others instead of merely absorbing
hits.|000

|CKBCore skills|000
|CK0bash disrupts a foe, cleave attacks with force, disarm removes a weapon,
fcharge closes on an enemy, fdefend guards an ally, and shield techniques,
counterattacks, frenzy, and surge cover defense and sustained pressure.|000

|CKBBest fit|000
|CK0Choose Fighter if you want broad equipment freedom, clear martial tools,
strong survivability, and a guild that rewards learning when to attack,
interrupt, defend, or recover Endurance.|000

|CK0After joining, use |CKBfhelp advancement|CK0, |CKBfhelp endurance|CK0, and
|CKBfs|CK0 for the full skill list.|000

